        ["2"] = <"Regional Research and Education Centre for Security, Prisons and Forensic Psychiatry. V-RISK-Y [Internet]. Revised 2024 Jun 21. Oslo: Oslo University Hospital, South-Eastern Norway Regional Health Authority; [cited 2026 May 15]. Available from: https://www.sifer.no/verktoy/#v-risk-y">
